@file 61: if {![file exists $IO_FILE]} {...}
@file 64:
@@file 65: read_io_file $IO_FILE
Reading IO assignment file "/home/icd1/workspace/RISC-V-PROCESSOR-45nm/physical_design/pins_mmmc.io" ...
